# Local-only job hunt control panel. Never deploys.
#
# Two independent layers keep this off the public site:
#   1. This file — excludes the route from CLI deploys entirely.
#   2. src/app/dashboard/page.tsx calls notFound() unless NODE_ENV is
#      'development', so even a Git-connected build serves a 404.
#
# Note: .vercelignore applies to Vercel CLI deploys. For Git-connected
# projects the whole repo is cloned, so layer 2 is the one that always holds.
src/app/dashboard
